Package: R.SamcPackage
Type: Package
Title: SAMC Simulation in Pure R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dayeon", "Kim", , "dayun0405@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A pure R implementation of Example 1 from Liang, Liu and
    Carroll (2007), "Stochastic Approximation in Monte Carlo Computation"
    (Journal of the American Statistical Association, 102(477), 305-320).
    Runs stochastic approximation Monte Carlo over a 10-state space
    partitioned into 5 subsets and reports the estimated subset weights,
    visiting frequencies, and the gain-factor estimation error. This is
    the reference implementation of the three language backends in this
    repository; see also 'C.SamcPackage' and 'P.SamcPackage'.
